   "date": "2022-03-30",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Aboriginal Land Grant (Jervis Bay Territory) Amendment (Strengthening Land and Governance Provisions) Bill 2022 was moved for a second reading, co-designed with the Wreck Bay community to strengthen council governance, increase the contract spending limit from $100,000 to $1 million, enable homeownership-style leases, and update the act’s title to include waters."
